      "type": "info",
      "text": "The **current region** is the entire block of data surrounding your active cell, bounded by blank rows and columns. `Ctrl+Shift+8` selects the current region (Mac: `Ctrl+Shift+8`). `Ctrl+Shift+End` extends from the active cell to the sheet's last used cell (Mac: `⌘⇧End`). `F8` toggles Extend Selection mode (Mac: `fn+F8`)."
